<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Advtech buys three education, training firms.</title>
<headline>Advtech buys three education, training firms.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Training and education group Advanced Technical Systems Ltd said on Wednesday it had acquired Rosebank College, Professional Events Coordinators and Whitehead Morris for 13 million rand.</p>
<p>The company also said it was contemplating further acquisitions.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
